<title>POLAND: EFEKT JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>EFEKT JULY NET RISES TO PLN 0.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.15 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.25 vs   0.17</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.20 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Sales		    2.27 vs   1.48</p>
