<p> Sales		   16.43 vs   9.10</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler is Korporacja</p>
<p>Gospodarcza Efekt SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
